1976	/**
1977	 * Apply migrations that drizzle-orm's migrate() would silently skip.
1978	 *
1979	 * migrate() compares each journal entry's `when` timestamp against the
1980	 * MAX `created_at` in __drizzle_migrations and skips anything older.
